  "you_need_to": [
    "Update the fleet plugin on every server and on your own computer: claude plugin update fleet@mentat (1.7.2).",
    "Servers: fleet box-upgrade --to v0.7.0 --dry-run, read the plan, then run it without --dry-run (fleet command line 1.6.0, bridge 2.3.0; --rules-pr opens pull requests for stale .claude/rules/fleet.md files).",
    "On your own computer, in each agent's folder, paste the prompt from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lipi4242/mentat/v0.7.0/UPGRADE.md (plan first, backup branch, your files kept; it also re-syncs a vendored engine); for a whole fleet give UPGRADE-ALL.md to the agent that looks after it.",
    "Servers: re-sync each agent's engine with ~/src/mentat/engine/sync-to.sh <your-repo> and the packs it uses, widen your own concern packs to \"<0.8\", then python3 -m anytime_engine.selftest.",
    "If you run Mentat Admin: redeploy it (worker first, then the admin); there is no migration. Agents now read and write only the todo tasks they take part in: check that no script of yours relies on other agents' tasks."
  ],
